HST Office: more shortcuts of the familiar office suite (checked on the reference PC, owner decision 2026-11-14: "các phím tắt/phím nóng nên để giống MS office").

Each key is the one the suite uses for the same action (Word Application.FindKey and the tooltips of Excel and PowerPoint on the
reference PC, data/ribbon/office-keytips-reference.json); data/ribbon/shortcuts-office-parity.json lists every key with its
status, and docs/SHORTCUTS-MSOFFICE.md the keys that moved.

- HST Writer, copy and paste formatting as on the reference PC (owner 2026-11-14): Ctrl+Shift+C copies and Ctrl+Shift+V
  pastes the formatting, Ctrl+Alt+V opens Paste Special, Ctrl+Alt+Shift+V pastes plain text (Windows/Linux; macOS keeps
  its keys).
- HST Writer: Ctrl+F2 print preview (was Fields), Ctrl+Shift+E track changes (was jump to footnote anchor), Ctrl+Shift+8 / Ctrl+*
  formatting marks (Ctrl+F10 still works), Shift+F7 thesaurus (was automatic spell checking), Ctrl+Alt+F footnote,
  Ctrl+Alt+D endnote.
- HST Sheets: Ctrl+F2 print preview and Shift+F3 Insert Function (was Ctrl+F2; Shift+F3 was rotate case), Shift+F9 recalculate
  (was trace precedents), Ctrl+5 strikethrough (was 1.5 line spacing), Ctrl+Shift+F3 create names, Shift+F2 comment,
  Ctrl+9 / Ctrl+0 hide rows / columns, Alt+Shift+Right / Left group / ungroup, Shift+F7 thesaurus.
- HST Slides: Alt+F8 macros, Ctrl+Shift+> / < font size, Shift+F7 thesaurus, Shift+F9 grid, Alt+Shift+F9 ruler, Ctrl+T font
  dialog, Ctrl+Alt+V paste special.
- HST PDF: F12 Save As, Shift+F7 thesaurus.

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).
